<p>NOTE -- Unusual Charge: To avoid a possible change in the company's ability to continue to manage two facilities resulting from the reduction in the founder's ownership interest in the company following the IPO, the company made a $1,000,000 cash payment in June 1996 to the third-party limited partner in these two facilities.</p>
